1
00:00:00,903 --> 00:00:03,493
(Sheldon:)There are myriad weapons,
vehicles and strategies to master...

2
00:00:03,656 --> 00:00:05,486
...not to mention an intricate back-story.

3
00:00:05,658 --> 00:00:06,698
[EXPLOSION ON TV]

4
00:00:06,867 --> 00:00:10,157
Oh, cool!
Whose head did I just blow off?

5
00:00:10,788 --> 00:00:11,828
(Sheldon:)Mine.

6
00:00:12,998 --> 00:00:16,168
(Penny:)Okay, I got this. Lock and load, boys.

7
00:00:16,752 --> 00:00:18,792
(Leonard:)It's the only way we can play teams.

8
00:00:18,963 --> 00:00:22,253
(Sheldon:)Whoever's her partner will be hamstrung
by her lack of experience, not to mention...

9
00:00:22,424 --> 00:00:23,464
[EXPLOSION ON TV]

10
00:00:23,634 --> 00:00:25,554
Ha-ha! There goes your head again.

11
00:00:26,178 --> 00:00:29,768
Okay, it's not good sportsmanship
to shoot somebody who's just re-spawned.

12
00:00:29,932 --> 00:00:31,852
(Sheldon:)You need to give them a chance to...
Now, come on.

13
00:00:32,017 --> 00:00:33,017
[EXPLOSION ON TV]

14
00:00:33,227 --> 00:00:35,147
(Sheldon:)Raj, Raj, she's got me cornered.
Cover me.

15
00:00:35,312 --> 00:00:37,442
(Penny:)Cover this, suckers.

16
00:00:37,606 --> 00:00:38,646
[CHUCKLING]

17
00:00:38,816 --> 00:00:39,896
(Leonard:)Penny, you are on fire.

18
00:00:40,067 --> 00:00:42,197
Yeah, and so is Sheldon.

19
00:00:42,361 --> 00:00:43,691
[LAUGHING]

20
00:00:44,029 --> 00:00:46,819
(Sheldon:)Okay, that's it.
I don't know how, but she is cheating.

21
00:00:46,991 --> 00:00:50,581
No one can be that attractive
and this skilled at a video game.

22
00:00:50,744 --> 00:00:52,954
(Penny:)Wait, Sheldon, come back.
You forgot something.

23
00:00:53,122 --> 00:00:54,202
(Penny:)What?

24
00:00:54,373 --> 00:00:56,083
(Penny:)This plasma grenade.

25
00:00:56,250 --> 00:00:57,750
[EXPLOSION ON TV]

26
00:00:58,502 --> 00:01:02,022
(Penny:)Ha! Look, it's raining you.

